From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thibaut Lapierre <root@epheo.eu>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/16] multinode: worker healthcheck

The worker role marker /var/lib/microshift/multinode-worker (it holds the
control plane IP) makes the healthcheck gate a worker on its own Node
being Ready, the only thing its kubelet credentials can read.

On a multinode control plane, DaemonSets are judged by the pod on this
node only: a NotReady worker kept its pods unavailable and rolled the
control plane back over another machine's outage.

Covered by: unit test (own-node DaemonSet check), multinode-test (worker
greenboot, controller green while the worker is down).
---
